<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line" lang="en">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">AgentX: Towards Orchestrating Robust Agentic Workflow Patterns with FaaS-hosted MCP Services</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Shiva Sai Krishna Anand Tokal
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
